OL,3,AJury considering verdicts for US mother
OL,4,Aaccused of murdering her three children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury is considering verdicts in the
OL,7,Fcase of Lindsay Clancy, an American
OL,8,Fwoman accused of murdering her three
OL,9,Fchildren - what options do they have?
OL,11,FThe 36-year-old is charged with three
OL,12,Fcounts of first-degree murder over the
OL,13,Fdeaths of Cora, five, Dawson, three,
OL,14,Fand eight-month-old Callan in 2023
OL,16,FClancy's lawyers have not disputed that
OL,17,Fshe killed her children, but argue she
OL,18,Fwas a "damn good mother" who was
OL,19,Fsuffering from psychosis
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
