OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prosecution alleges the former
OL,7,Flabour and delivery nurse intentionally
OL,8,Fstrangled and killed her children
OL,10,FProsecutor Jennifer Sprague argues
OL,11,FClancy had an "abundance of care", but
OL,12,Fsays she hid thoughts about harming her
OL,13,Fkids from doctors
